				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたしねー
キュートな　ポケモンが　いると▽
くぎづけに　なっちゃう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・ヒント</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL3</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
